    "validation_rules": {
      "limitations": [
        "This finite demonstration computes declared CO2 components, not complete verified CBAM emissions.",
        "Sinter precursor electricity is applicable and pending an eligible CBAM factor; casting electricity is excluded from this crude-steel component.",
        "Internal sinter and hot metal are precursors. Joint monitoring requires same-installation, no-sale and no-other-use evidence; graph membership alone is insufficient.",
        "Waste-gas transfer, power and heat attribution are not implemented. The net direction of omitted effects is unknown; no conservative-upper-bound claim is made.",
        "Purchased heat, steam, cleaning reagents, auxiliary carbon and slag residual carbon are not fully covered by this case. An absent port does not establish non-applicability.",
        "Electrodes are not categorically forbidden by the BF-BOF label. Actual use requires an applicable source-stream method; this case does not cover it.",
